WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,850 --> 00:00:01,750
It’s long gone

2
00:00:02,010 --> 00:00:03,170
Full material supply base

3
00:00:03,490 --> 00:00:05,650
We soldiers only have one dish and one soup every day.

4
00:00:06,170 --> 00:00:07,090
K1 base

5
00:00:07,410 --> 00:00:11,090
You even know our base, sister

6
00:00:11,970 --> 00:00:15,720
Why don't you come back to K1 with us? Don't laugh.

7
00:00:15,880 --> 00:00:17,040
You have a bad temper and are a little bit arrogant.

8
00:00:17,040 --> 00:00:19,080
But the strength is really strong

9
00:00:19,440 --> 00:00:21,120
I think you are more powerful than our captain

10
00:00:21,240 --> 00:00:22,920
If you join us, we can always be together

11
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:24,080
Thinking about poaching them

12
00:00:24,320 --> 00:00:25,600
They want to poach me

13
00:00:27,010 --> 00:00:29,010
Can you make a stew with meat?

14
00:00:29,090 --> 00:00:30,210
Where do you want to go?

15
00:00:30,410 --> 00:00:31,330
Are you comfortable every day?

16
00:00:31,370 --> 00:00:32,490
Meet someone you are unhappy with

17
00:00:32,850 --> 00:00:33,890
Can it be cut directly?

18
00:00:35,410 --> 00:00:36,810
Then I will kill and join you

19
00:00:37,130 --> 00:00:38,300
for honor

20
00:00:40,590 --> 00:00:41,550
Honor you

21
00:00:42,420 --> 00:00:44,540
Honor is when you work hard outside

22
00:00:44,540 --> 00:00:45,980
In the end, there was no rescue
